    "detailed_description": "Welcome to an exhilarating journey through the vast expanses of space! In our game, you will assume the role of Sophia, a brave heroine who sets out on a quest to find her lost friend. Her name is Olga, and she vanished without a trace, leading Sophia into a dangerous game of cosmic mysteries.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn a world where populations reside in city-states on different planets, space exploration is a relatively new phenomenon. Sophia must conquer uncharted territories, encounter different races, and explore their unique cultures in her quest to find Olga. To locate her friend, she must decipher the secrets of this world and overcome the perils that await her in the depths of space.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs you progress through the main storyline, you will unravel intriguing hypotheses about Olga's possible whereabouts. Perhaps she embarked on a search for a mysterious planet hidden from all. Solve puzzles, battle enemies, and gather clues to find and rescue Olga.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour adventure in the cosmic galaxy is only just beginning. Gradually unlock new realms and discover the worlds that lie before you. Become Sophia, a determined heroine willing to do whatever it takes to bring back her friend and unravel the mysteries concealed within the vastness of space.",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to an exhilarating journey through the vast expanses of space! In our game, you will assume the role of Sophia, a brave heroine who sets out on a quest to find her lost friend. Her name is Olga, and she vanished without a trace, leading Sophia into a dangerous game of cosmic mysteries.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn a world where populations reside in city-states on different planets, space exploration is a relatively new phenomenon. Sophia must conquer uncharted territories, encounter different races, and explore their unique cultures in her quest to find Olga. To locate her friend, she must decipher the secrets of this world and overcome the perils that await her in the depths of space.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs you progress through the main storyline, you will unravel intriguing hypotheses about Olga's possible whereabouts. Perhaps she embarked on a search for a mysterious planet hidden from all. Solve puzzles, battle enemies, and gather clues to find and rescue Olga.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour adventure in the cosmic galaxy is only just beginning. Gradually unlock new realms and discover the worlds that lie before you. Become Sophia, a determined heroine willing to do whatever it takes to bring back her friend and unravel the mysteries concealed within the vastness of space.",
    "short_description": "Embark on a cosmic journey as Sophia, a brave heroine searching for her lost friend Olga. Explore uncharted worlds, encounter diverse races, and unravel cosmic mysteries. Will you find Olga amidst the depths of space? Battle enemies, solve puzzles, and unlock new realms in this captivating adventure",
